    "notes": "USDe is a synthetic dollar rather than a fiat reserve stablecoin; GENIUS payment-stablecoin applicability is unresolved pending final rulemaking and the mandated non-payment stablecoin study. Ethena is separately pursuing GENIUS-compliant issuance via USDtb (partnered with Anchorage Digital Bank) — that is a distinct product issued by a separate entity (Pallas BVI Ltd / Anchorage Digital Bank). No GENIUS Act enforcement actions exist and the Act is not yet effective (effective date: 2027-01-18 at latest).",
